          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is the Express Test and Tag Course structured? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The start of this course consists of theory and OHS training, which is self-paced and completed online. It features interactive videos and assessments, allowing flexible completion within 3-4 hours per module before attending the face-to-face practical session. <br/><br/>The practical component is conducted face-to-face; our expert trainers will guide you on how to use a PAT Tester in a small-sized class. This will ensure you have an interactive learning experience and are given all the help you need. All of the training equipment will be provided during this session. The practical section goes for 4 hours, with times available at 8am-12pm and 1pm-5pm. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jP3dUU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is the Express Course different from the regular course?  ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Express Test & Tag Course takes half the amount of time in our classroom as our regular course. This is because the theory component is completed at your own pace before the course. Then once the training begins, it focuses solely on the practical hands-on part of how to properly test and tag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YAFc4k": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who will be the trainer on the day?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We have several trainers, all of which are test and tag industry professionals with many years of experience and are fully qualified. In addition, they’re all very friendly and approachable and will make the training an enjoyable experience. Whatever your reason for doing the course is, we guarantee our trainers will give you all the knowledge and skills required to successfully test and tag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DhYd67": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I need technical support after the course?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll have the peace of mind knowing that we'll be there when you need us, whether it's by phone, email or in person. Every single student taught by Test & Tag Training receives free lifetime technical support from our team of experts. Guaranteed. This could be anything from how to use a specific appliance tester or how to test and tag a particular electrical appliance. We want to ensure we're making people's jobs easier by offering dependable service and expert advice when you need it most.</p>",
